<div class="container">

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Introduction</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>Food Merge: Match &amp; Story</strong>, developed by <strong>The Three Zero Company</strong>. We are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you play our game.</p>
        <p>By downloading or using the game, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device type, operating system version, and unique device identifiers (used for advertising purposes)</li>
            <li><strong>Gameplay Data:</strong> Scores, progress, and in-game purchases (stored locally on your device)</li>
            <li><strong>Advertising Data:</strong> Ad interaction data collected by Google AdMob to serve relevant ads</li>
            <li><strong>Purchase Information:</strong> In-app purchase records processed securely by Google Play</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="highlight">
            ⚠️ We do <strong>NOT</strong> collect your name, phone number, or personally identifiable information directly.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>To provide and improve the game experience</li>
            <li>To serve advertisements through Google AdMob</li>
            <li>To process in-app purchases via Google Play Billing</li>
            <li>To save your game progress and high scores locally</li>
            <li>To analyze app performance and fix bugs</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our game uses the following third-party services that may collect data:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Google AdMob</strong> — For displaying advertisements. AdMob may collect device identifiers and usage data. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy →</a></li>
            <li><strong>Google Play Billing</strong> — For processing in-app purchases. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy →</a></li>
            <li><strong>Unity Analytics</strong> — For crash reporting and performance monitoring.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Advertising</h2>
        <p>Our game contains advertisements provided by <strong>Google AdMob</strong>. These ads may use your device's advertising ID to show relevant ads. You can opt out of personalized advertising by:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Going to your device <strong>Settings → Google → Ads → Opt out of Ads Personalization</strong></li>
            <li>Purchasing the <strong>"Remove Ads"</strong> option available within the game</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>In-App Purchases</h2>
        <p>Food Merge: Match &amp; Story offers optional in-app purchases including coin packs and ad removal. All purchases are processed securely through <strong>Google Play Store</strong>. We do not store your payment information. All transactions are subject to Google Play's Terms of Service.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our game is intended for users aged <strong>13 and older</strong>. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe your child has provided personal information, please contact us immediately and we will delete such information.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Data Storage & Security</h2>
        <p>Your game progress and scores are stored <strong>locally on your device</strong> using PlayerPrefs. We implement reasonable security measures to protect any data. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access the data we hold about you</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data (by uninstalling the app or contacting us)</li>
            <li>Opt out of personalized advertising</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To delete all local game data, simply uninstall the app from your device.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
        <p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:thethreezerocompany@gmail.com">thethreezerocompany@gmail.com</a></p>
